Q: META-MATH: Mark is buying asphalt to pave a new section of road. The road will be 2000 feet long and 20 feet wide. Each truckload of asphalt will cover 800 square feet of road. If each truckload costs x, and there's a 20% sales tax, how much will Mark need to pay for asphalt?
