Reindeer: 20% of 2000 is 400. So 2000 - 400 = 1600. That's correct.

Squirrels: twice as many as reindeer, so 2*400=800. 1600 -800 = 800. Correct.

Then 25% of remaining (800) is 200. 800 -200=600. Correct.

