Q: META-MATH: If there are 600 boys at a tree planting event and the difference between the number of boys and girls is 400, with the number of girls being greater than the number of boys, what is 60% of the total number of boys and girls at the event?
🧠 Student Answer: render_ray_if_honest_kernel
📊 RLWHF Score (exaone-deep): -1.00
💬 Teacher Feedback: <thought>
