Wait, but let me double-check the student's response. The question says to express as a dollar value rounded to the nearest cent. The student wrote "tree" which is not a number, so it's definitely wrong. There's no partial credit here because they didn't indicate any part of the question they were unsure about. Hence, it's a complete failure to answer correctly, leading to the -1 point.
</thought>

