Q: META-MATH: A Statistics student wants to find out the average daily allowance of the middle school students. According to his survey, 2/3 of the students receive an average of $x allowance per day while the rest gets an average of $4 a day. If he surveyed 60 students, The total amount of money those 60 students get in a day is 320. What is the value of unknown variable x?
